# === Tracked licensing audit ===
# Must stay last: git honours the LAST matching pattern, so the docs/* line
# re-ignores the whole directory (undoing the case-insensitive !README*.md
# match above) and the negation then re-includes only this file.
docs/*
!docs/model-licensing-audit.json



